# 统一换行符：仓库与工作区一律 LF，避免 Windows clone 后 gradlew 带 CRLF 无法执行，
# 也避免每条 git 命令刷「LF will be replaced by CRLF」的噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

# Gradle wrapper 脚本必须保持各自平台的原生换行
gradlew text eol=lf
gradlew.bat text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf

# 二进制：禁止换行转换与文本 diff
*.jar binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary

# 语言统计
*.kt text
*.kts text
*.py text
*.md text
